    "text": "Work done by force F;<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mover><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>x</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>y</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mi>&#160;</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8757;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>a</mi></munderover><mfrac><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></m